00:35:57.290 --> 00:36:00.000
We lived in a village of light.

00:36:00.000 --> 00:36:01.500
a place called Hikari-no-Sono.

00:36:01.500 --> 00:36:02.500
Hikari-no-Sono?

00:36:02.500 --> 00:36:05.500
It's a place where flowers always bloom,

00:36:05.500 --> 00:36:07.910
and it's a beautiful place.

00:36:07.910 --> 00:36:09.950
The inhabitants of Hikari-no-Sono

00:36:09.950 --> 00:36:12.950
