00:36:23.470 --> 00:36:26.770
It's called the Dotsuku Zone.

00:36:26.770 --> 00:36:30.000
Hikari-no-Sono was afraid of being eaten up by the Dotsuku Zone,

00:36:30.320 --> 00:36:40.200
Queen and the elders entrusted Rhythm Stone to Mipple, the chosen heroine of the Hope Princess, to escape!

00:36:40.200 --> 00:36:41.930
Rhythm Stone?

00:36:41.930 --> 00:36:45.650
It's the Stone of Life that Mipple and I have, Mippo!

00:36:45.650 --> 00:36:48.810
