00:48:46.610 --> 00:48:47.570
I'm so sorry, Dark King.

00:48:47.570 --> 00:48:55.320
I'm so sorry, Dark King.

00:48:55.320 --> 00:48:56.320
I'm so sorry, Dark King.

00:48:56.320 --> 00:48:57.560
I'm so sorry, Dark King.

00:48:57.560 --> 00:48:58.910
I'm so sorry, Dark King.

00:48:58.910 --> 00:48:59.920
I'm so sorry, Dark King.

