00:54:46.670 --> 00:54:49.230
You know what?

00:54:49.230 --> 00:54:55.260
Was it good?

00:54:55.260 --> 00:54:59.190
Yes.

00:54:59.190 --> 00:55:00.000
Your eyes.

00:55:00.600 --> 00:55:02.600
I'm gonna find out! When did you wake up!?

00:55:02.600 --> 00:55:05.450
I can't take a nap all the time, Meppo.

00:55:07.430 --> 00:55:08.270
This is your house.

00:55:08.270 --> 00:55:10.470
No way!

00:55:10.470 --> 00:55:13.010
This is Yukishiro-san's house!?

00:55:13.010 --> 00:55:14.010
Here you go.

00:55:14.010 --> 00:55:15.600
Excuse me.

00:55:15.600 --> 00:55:17.710
