00:55:17.710 --> 00:55:19.050
It's huge.

00:55:21.100 --> 00:55:23.080
What's this!?

00:55:23.080 --> 00:55:24.530
What's this!?

00:55:24.530 --> 00:55:30.000
What's this!?

00:55:31.080 --> 00:55:39.020
You're such a hero!

00:55:39.020 --> 00:55:40.310
That's right.

00:55:40.310 --> 00:55:43.030
My dad and mom are not here right now.

00:55:43.030 --> 00:55:45.000
Are you working?

00:55:45.000 --> 00:55:46.860
