00:55:46.860 --> 00:55:48.050
Abroad?

00:55:48.050 --> 00:55:48.930
Yes.

00:55:48.930 --> 00:55:51.800
Kasayafu-san was here a little while ago,

00:55:51.800 --> 00:55:54.600
