00:57:48.500 --> 00:57:52.800
If all seven Prism Stones were stolen...

00:57:52.800 --> 00:58:00.000
The Shrine of Light will lose its power to live, and all will be eaten up by the Dotsukus, Mippo!

00:58:00.190 --> 00:58:02.160
That's why, I beg you, Mepo!

00:58:02.160 --> 00:58:05.270
Protect us from the Dotsuku Zones, Mepo!

00:58:05.270 --> 00:58:10.230
That is the mission of the legendary warrior, Precure, which is transmitted to the Shrine of Light, Mepo!

00:58:10.230 --> 00:58:13.320
No matter what you say...

00:58:13.320 --> 00:58:20.320
If all the Prism Stones are taken away, no one will be able to stop the Dotsuku Zones anymore, Mepo!

00:58:20.320 --> 00:58:24.100
After the Shrine of Light is eaten up, this Rainbow Shrine, Mepo!

00:58:24.100 --> 00:58:30.000
And someday, the whole world will become a dark world that has lost its power to live, Mepo!

00:58:31.720 --> 00:58:38.840
The only one who can save the entire world is the legendary warrior with the power of light, Precure!

00:58:38.840 --> 00:58:42.920
Isn't that a big story?

00:58:42.920 --> 00:58:47.160
I'm tired of seeing myself like this in the Rainbow Garden, Mipo.

00:58:47.160 --> 00:58:50.600
I knew this would calm me down, Mipo!

00:58:50.600 --> 00:58:51.670
Mipo?

00:58:51.670 --> 00:58:57.910
Why do people in the Dotsuku Zone try so hard to get the Prism Stone?

00:58:57.910 --> 00:58:59.800
I don't know.

00:59:04.280 --> 00:59:06.550
I brought you some books.

00:59:06.550 --> 00:59:10.650
Thank you.

00:59:10.650 --> 00:59:12.540
Welcome.

00:59:12.540 --> 00:59:14.470
This is Miss Misumi, my classmate.

00:59:14.470 --> 00:59:16.630
I'm Nagisa Misumi.

00:59:16.630 --> 00:59:19.610
Oh, what a lovely young lady you are.

00:59:19.610 --> 00:59:21.600
My name is Sanae Sobono.

00:59:21.600 --> 00:59:26.880
It's been a long time since Honoka brought her friends.

00:59:26.880 --> 00:59:30.000
She's always alone, reading books all the time.

00:59:31.280 --> 00:59:32.520
Is that so?

00:59:32.520 --> 00:59:35.030
It's fine. I like it.

00:59:35.030 --> 00:59:37.560
Oh, that suits you.

00:59:37.560 --> 00:59:43.130
Grandma, I'm sorry, but we're busy.

00:59:43.130 --> 00:59:48.470
Yes, yes, we will leave.

00:59:48.470 --> 00:59:53.300
Nagisa-san, take care of Honoka.

00:59:53.300 --> 00:59:54.880
Well then...

00:59:54.880 --> 00:59:56.340
Ah...

01:00:20.830 --> 01:00:22.900
You're an educational trainee?

01:00:22.900 --> 01:00:25.820
I'm afraid I won't be able to come today because of the cold.

01:00:25.820 --> 01:00:28.610
But I'm glad I could come!

01:00:28.610 --> 01:00:30.000
Let's hang out together.

01:00:30.000 --> 01:00:31.870
Let's study.

01:00:31.870 --> 01:00:36.060
It was Naoto Yamaguchi, an educational trainee.

01:00:36.060 --> 01:00:38.760
Well, he's handsome, but he's still handsome.

01:00:38.760 --> 01:00:48.050
The last one is Ryuichi Kazama.

01:00:48.050 --> 01:00:53.020
Wow, he's such a good boy.

01:00:53.020 --> 01:00:57.590
He should be in here.

01:00:57.590 --> 01:01:00.000
Kazama-sensei, can I ask you something?

01:01:08.380 --> 01:01:10.240
I found it.

01:01:30.600 --> 01:01:45.220
I think I got a little angry at the education practice.

01:01:45.220 --> 01:01:52.980
I see. Is that the young master?

01:02:02.560 --> 01:02:06.320
I'm Kazama-sensei's instructor, Yoshimi Takenouchi.

01:02:06.320 --> 01:02:10.090
Nice to meet you.

01:02:10.090 --> 01:02:13.150
You can call me Yoshimi.

01:02:13.150 --> 01:02:19.120
I can't believe that Kazama-sensei and I are teaching in the same school.

01:02:19.120 --> 01:02:24.170
I feel like it's destiny.

01:02:24.170 --> 01:02:26.040
Haha, you're so shy.

01:02:26.040 --> 01:02:30.000
Men under your age are so cute.

01:02:31.120 --> 01:02:34.700
Kazama-sensei, the class is about to start, so let's hurry.

01:02:44.590 --> 01:02:45.530
If we get caught...

01:02:47.250 --> 01:02:49.010
First, bring this guy here.

01:02:57.220 --> 01:02:58.280
I'll be waiting here.

01:02:58.700 --> 01:02:59.160
Yes.

01:03:00.760 --> 01:03:04.470
Misumi-san, could you please help the teacher?

01:03:04.470 --> 01:03:05.410
Yes!

01:03:08.710 --> 01:03:09.700
Huh?

01:03:09.700 --> 01:03:12.760
Kazama-sensei, what's up with your class?

01:03:12.760 --> 01:03:16.680
It's...

01:03:16.680 --> 01:03:21.490
Oh, it's okay, it's okay.

01:03:21.490 --> 01:03:25.670
Isn't the teacher late?

01:03:25.670 --> 01:03:27.270
He's talking, he's talking, he's talking!

01:03:27.270 --> 01:03:29.640
I-I'll go take a look!

01:03:31.820 --> 01:03:33.990
What do you need me for?

01:03:33.990 --> 01:03:36.030
I'll know once I get in.

01:03:40.890 --> 01:03:42.890
I've been waiting for you, Miss.

01:03:42.890 --> 01:03:46.350
Huh? Isn't that the teacher from earlier?

01:03:46.350 --> 01:03:50.600
Would you like me to show you the Prism Stone?

01:03:50.600 --> 01:03:51.600
The Prism Stone...

01:03:51.600 --> 01:03:52.750
No way!

01:03:52.750 --> 01:03:54.870
It's too late to notice.

01:03:56.460 --> 01:03:59.810
Now...

01:04:00.000 --> 01:04:01.250
Bring out the stone.

01:04:01.250 --> 01:04:04.290
If you don't, I don't know what will happen to this guy.

01:04:04.290 --> 01:04:07.360
It's no use calling me.

01:04:07.360 --> 01:04:09.280
What did you do?

01:04:09.280 --> 01:04:11.040
It's fine, so bring it out quickly.

01:04:11.040 --> 01:04:13.250
I don't have that kind of thing!

01:04:13.250 --> 01:04:14.600
Don't be stupid!

01:04:17.770 --> 01:04:20.080
If you really have it!

01:04:20.080 --> 01:04:21.190
It's fine.

01:04:21.190 --> 01:04:26.840
Yukishiro-san!

01:04:26.840 --> 01:04:29.540
I have what you want here!

01:04:33.390 --> 01:04:36.500
Well, shall I give it to you?

01:04:36.500 --> 01:04:41.110
The game is over!

01:06:02.140 --> 01:06:20.350
Inosha! Cure Black!

01:06:20.350 --> 01:06:23.290
Today is the day I will stop breathing!

01:06:23.290 --> 01:06:26.240
The mad heaven and earth, The Kenner!

01:06:26.240 --> 01:06:30.000
The terror of the power of darkness that devours everything!

01:06:41.320 --> 01:06:41.880
Where is she?

01:07:31.850 --> 01:07:37.490
-Chimichurri-sensei! -Go away! Don't mess with me!

01:08:00.000 --> 01:08:01.200
I'll get rid of you!

01:08:01.200 --> 01:08:02.130
Don't mess with me!

01:08:09.000 --> 01:08:11.420
Don't mess with me!

01:08:11.420 --> 01:08:13.300
I-it's not good, Pa!

01:08:18.840 --> 01:08:26.600
I'll finish you off!

01:09:01.280 --> 01:09:02.240
Black Sun!

01:10:05.120 --> 01:10:09.470
Hey, hey, hey, the three of you won't be coming back, right? What's going on?

01:10:09.470 --> 01:10:12.200
I'm lucky that I don't have any lessons.

01:10:12.200 --> 01:10:14.500
Yeah, you're right, you're right, you're right.

01:10:14.500 --> 01:10:16.070
Ahaha...

01:10:16.070 --> 01:10:20.680
What's wrong?

01:10:20.680 --> 01:10:28.840
Teacher Kazama...

01:10:28.840 --> 01:10:30.000
I'm so glad.

01:10:30.280 --> 01:10:30.980
Huh?

01:10:30.980 --> 01:10:33.840
What are you doing here?

01:10:33.840 --> 01:10:34.480
Huh?

01:10:34.480 --> 01:10:36.390
No, I mean...

01:10:36.390 --> 01:10:38.350
You're in class now, right?

01:10:38.350 --> 01:10:40.400
I wasn't skipping class...

01:10:40.400 --> 01:10:42.520
Even you, the class president!

01:10:42.520 --> 01:10:47.160
You two, go back to your classroom!

01:10:47.160 --> 01:10:50.360
I don't remember anything...

01:10:50.360 --> 01:10:52.880
Don't go anywhere and just walk!

01:10:52.880 --> 01:10:53.650
Geez!

01:11:31.180 --> 01:11:31.960
So,

01:12:35.690 --> 01:12:37.090
do you think I'll have snacks next time?

01:12:37.090 --> 01:12:39.570
There are no snacks for the next social tour!

01:12:39.570 --> 01:12:41.730
But, but, I'm not used to this kind of thing!

01:12:41.730 --> 01:12:43.070
More than that...

01:12:43.070 --> 01:12:54.130
Kishiro-san!

01:12:54.130 --> 01:12:55.680
Can I put this in the dessert?

01:12:55.680 --> 01:12:57.910
There are no desserts for the next social tour!

01:13:06.140 --> 01:13:10.280
Mepple and Mikle came running with the Prism Stone from the Garden of Light.

01:13:10.280 --> 01:13:15.880
Because we met them, we became a team to fight against those ridiculous people.

01:13:15.880 --> 01:13:22.880
In any case, it is our duty to protect them.

01:13:22.880 --> 01:13:30.000
Come on, let me enjoy my school life normally.

01:13:31.690 --> 01:13:33.010
Misumi-san?

01:13:33.010 --> 01:13:34.670
Yes, I can't.

01:13:34.670 --> 01:13:35.610
Why not?

01:13:35.610 --> 01:13:36.280
Eh?

01:13:36.280 --> 01:13:37.460
Ah...

01:13:37.460 --> 01:13:40.530
You're a member of the Society Tourism Association, aren't you?

01:13:40.530 --> 01:13:42.400
You can't just sit around, right?

01:13:42.400 --> 01:13:43.920
Ah...

01:13:43.920 --> 01:13:46.810
Good morning.

01:13:46.810 --> 01:13:49.430
Is the principal going too?

01:13:49.430 --> 01:13:54.270
Yes, sometimes I think of going to the art museum with the students.

01:13:54.270 --> 01:13:56.730
That's not something you can do easily.

01:13:56.730 --> 01:13:59.160
Ahaha, well then, let's go.

01:14:01.240 --> 01:14:06.160
Misumi-san, join forces with Yukishiro-san and gather everyone together.

01:14:06.160 --> 01:14:07.660
Let's do our best.

01:14:07.660 --> 01:14:09.440
I wonder what will happen.

01:15:30.000 --> 01:15:41.070
There are many famous works such as "Leonardo da Vinci", "Manet", "Dogan" and "Le Noir" at the Grand European Exhibition

01:15:41.070 --> 01:15:47.710
Hey, hey, hey, this is, this is, this is, the text is written by Yukishiro-san and the illustration is written by Nagisa-san!

01:15:47.710 --> 01:15:54.180
Puuu, wait!

01:15:54.180 --> 01:16:00.000
There are various other exhibits such as sculptures, so please enjoy!

01:16:00.000 --> 01:16:01.000
Please take a look.

01:16:01.000 --> 01:16:02.080
Um...

01:16:02.080 --> 01:16:03.090
Yes?

01:16:03.090 --> 01:16:04.070
What is it?

01:16:04.070 --> 01:16:07.620
It's not as famous as Da Vinci, but...

01:16:07.620 --> 01:16:12.480
There's a picture of my favorite painter called Mario Piccarini.

01:16:12.480 --> 01:16:14.560
Everyone, please take a look.

01:16:14.560 --> 01:16:16.910
Piccarini?

01:16:16.910 --> 01:16:20.910
It's a wonderful work called "The Supper of Stardust".

01:16:20.910 --> 01:16:24.830
It's the first time it's been exhibited in Japan.

01:16:24.830 --> 01:16:26.520
Wow...

01:16:26.520 --> 01:16:28.520
As expected of the art department. You know a lot.

01:16:28.520 --> 01:16:29.860
Piccarini is...

01:16:30.280 --> 01:16:35.560
About a hundred years ago, I was an Italian artist and a poor farmer's son-in-law.

01:16:35.560 --> 01:16:39.670
Unlike my brothers, I was clumsy in both ways.

01:16:39.670 --> 01:16:44.660
While working in the fields, I continued to draw and finally was recognized.

01:16:44.660 --> 01:16:47.640
I love such simple things.

01:16:47.640 --> 01:16:50.200
Amazing, amazing, amazing!

01:16:50.200 --> 01:16:52.600
You're a hard worker!

01:16:52.600 --> 01:16:56.920
No, I just like it.

01:16:56.920 --> 01:16:58.040
Hmm?

01:16:58.040 --> 01:16:59.700
Mayu, did you change your hairstyle?

01:17:04.600 --> 01:17:08.230
Don't you think it's similar to Nagisa's hairstyle?

01:17:08.230 --> 01:17:12.770
Ah, if you say so...

01:17:12.770 --> 01:17:14.280
It might be a little similar.

01:17:14.280 --> 01:17:17.440
Actually, I imitated it.

01:17:17.440 --> 01:17:23.170
I thought it was cool from before, so I thought I'd apologize for the hairstyle alone.

01:17:23.170 --> 01:17:26.220
I'm sorry if I made you feel bad.

01:17:26.220 --> 01:17:29.480
No way! You look better than me!

01:17:29.480 --> 01:17:30.000
Huh?

01:17:33.480 --> 01:17:34.660
Thank you.

01:17:34.660 --> 01:17:35.880
That student...

01:17:35.880 --> 01:17:37.760
Mayu Kashiwada?

01:17:37.760 --> 01:17:41.880
When she was in school, she was a more plain and dark girl, wasn't she?

01:17:41.880 --> 01:17:46.120
Yes. After she joined the art club, she became very active.

01:17:46.120 --> 01:17:49.040
Hmm, that's good.

01:18:00.090 --> 01:18:06.610
I will never let you fail again, P-3rd.

01:18:06.610 --> 01:18:11.700
I will bring back the Prism Stone.

01:18:11.700 --> 01:18:15.840
Otherwise, you will die.

01:18:17.880 --> 01:18:23.360
You can say it's impossible if it's impossible.

01:18:23.360 --> 01:18:27.170
But it's not for you.

01:18:27.170 --> 01:18:30.000
No matter how many times I say it, the result is...

01:18:30.000 --> 01:18:40.350
I don't know what kind of guy he is, but I think he's a little low level.

01:18:40.350 --> 01:18:46.180
Kiria, don't get carried away. I got a chance.

01:18:46.180 --> 01:18:49.400
You're going to risk your life.

01:19:11.800 --> 01:19:13.800
Go in the direction of the arrow!

01:19:16.310 --> 01:19:20.000
This painting is the famous impressionist painting of France.

01:19:20.000 --> 01:19:21.280
It's a painting, isn't it?

01:19:21.280 --> 01:19:28.570
What is it?

01:19:28.570 --> 01:19:30.000
You suddenly said that?

01:19:30.030 --> 01:19:30.850
Even if you tell me...

01:19:34.550 --> 01:19:35.450
What's with that voice?

01:19:41.230 --> 01:19:43.070
Sensei!

01:19:43.070 --> 01:19:45.980
I'm sorry!

01:19:45.980 --> 01:19:46.930
Mayu, I'll be in your care.

01:20:03.100 --> 01:20:05.920
Come on! You can't talk to me like that all of a sudden!

01:20:05.920 --> 01:20:08.120
I want to go to Mipple's side, Meppo!

01:20:08.120 --> 01:20:09.000
You can't!

01:20:09.000 --> 01:20:14.140
You promised that you'd be quiet today, even if you were to wake up in a special way, didn't you?

01:20:14.140 --> 01:20:15.940
Let me see you, Meppo!

01:20:15.940 --> 01:20:17.940
Or I'll remember this, Meppo!

01:20:21.190 --> 01:20:24.600
What are you doing?

01:20:24.600 --> 01:20:26.950
Ah! Mipple!

01:20:40.300 --> 01:20:44.840
There are a lot of things that can be broken here, so don't act on your own!

01:20:44.840 --> 01:20:46.130
Love, love?

01:20:46.130 --> 01:20:51.070
Where are the things that can be broken, Meco?

01:20:51.070 --> 01:20:52.700
They're all like that!

01:20:52.700 --> 01:20:57.110
For example, this sculpture looks very fragile even though it's hard.

01:21:09.920 --> 01:21:12.520
I don't know what's going to happen!

01:21:30.760 --> 01:21:31.650
It's kind of weird...

01:21:31.650 --> 01:21:35.450
Well, whatever...

01:21:35.450 --> 01:21:36.660
No, Mippo!

01:21:36.660 --> 01:21:38.580
I want to go over there, Mippo!

01:21:38.580 --> 01:21:46.260
Eh? What's wrong with this?

01:21:46.260 --> 01:21:51.880
I don't really understand, but it feels really nostalgic, Mippo!

01:21:51.880 --> 01:21:54.960
Huh?

01:21:54.960 --> 01:21:57.480
Could this be...

01:21:57.480 --> 01:22:00.000
Ah! It's a nipple, Mippo!

01:22:00.600 --> 01:22:02.080
There's no way I'd do that.

01:22:02.080 --> 01:22:03.240
Because, you see...

01:22:03.240 --> 01:22:06.440
A 1904 painting...

01:22:06.440 --> 01:22:10.880
Why is Mipple painted in a 100-year-old painting?

01:22:10.880 --> 01:22:13.030
A hundred years ago...

01:22:13.030 --> 01:22:24.800
It's been a long time since I've been to the rainbow forest.

01:22:24.800 --> 01:22:26.470
A long time ago?

01:22:26.470 --> 01:22:27.460
Yes.

01:22:27.460 --> 01:22:29.000
And...

01:22:29.000 --> 01:22:30.000
It's been a long time since I've been to the rainbow forest.

01:22:30.120 --> 01:22:32.390
I fell into the abyss of the abyss...

01:22:32.390 --> 01:22:39.340
For a very long time, I went over there and over there, and traveled to many places...

01:22:39.340 --> 01:22:44.480
When I woke up, I was in the dark of Honoka's house, Mippo.

01:22:44.480 --> 01:22:49.490
So, Mipple ran away 100 years later?

01:22:49.490 --> 01:22:54.490
She wanted to see you so much, but she was able to endure it for 100 years.

01:22:54.490 --> 01:22:58.500
I immediately chased Mippo after a day when Mipple went to the rainbow garden.

01:22:58.500 --> 01:23:00.000
After a day?

01:23:01.210 --> 01:23:03.210
What do you mean?

01:23:03.210 --> 01:23:06.520
I've heard about it from the elder.

01:23:06.520 --> 01:23:11.050
It seems that time flows differently when you go to a different world.

01:23:11.050 --> 01:23:13.800
Then how many of you are there?

01:23:13.800 --> 01:23:20.420
It's been a long time since I've been taken up by a research theme.

01:23:31.920 --> 01:23:36.270
Ah, Yukishiro-san!

01:23:36.270 --> 01:23:41.640
Oh, I forgot.

01:23:41.640 --> 01:23:59.700
I can't focus, and my body is weak.

01:24:00.730 --> 01:24:04.970
I heard that Piccadilly didn't have to worry about anything when he was a child.

01:24:06.820 --> 01:24:11.940
That night, Piccadilly was frustrated at school and was looking at the stars by himself.

01:24:19.490 --> 01:24:22.690
Flow star, give me your talent.

01:24:52.330 --> 01:25:00.000
The next morning after he picked up the star, he started drawing without looking aside, and when he realized it, he had become an artist recognized by the whole world.

01:25:01.370 --> 01:25:02.840
You really know a lot, don't you?

01:25:02.840 --> 01:25:07.170
I love it, so I read a lot of books and looked it up.

01:25:07.170 --> 01:25:10.400
It's important to believe in yourself.

01:25:10.400 --> 01:25:14.660
When I look at Piccarini's paintings, I feel a little bit of courage.

01:25:30.090 --> 01:25:30.550
Hmm...

01:25:30.550 --> 01:25:31.490
Hmm...

01:25:31.490 --> 01:25:32.780
Hmm...

01:25:32.780 --> 01:25:33.280
Hmm...

01:25:33.280 --> 01:25:42.020
Hmm...

01:25:42.020 --> 01:25:43.020
There's nothing to forget!

01:25:43.020 --> 01:25:44.260
Huh? Huh? Huh?

01:25:44.260 --> 01:25:46.100
What's wrong?

01:25:46.100 --> 01:25:47.640
Mayu's not here.

01:25:47.640 --> 01:25:49.040
That's right.

01:25:49.040 --> 01:25:51.610
Is she still inside?

01:25:51.610 --> 01:25:52.530
Oh?

01:25:52.530 --> 01:25:55.360
The principal's not here either.

01:25:55.360 --> 01:25:58.830
Shhh...

01:25:58.830 --> 01:25:59.990
Shhh...

01:26:12.280 --> 01:26:22.740
Those two are not here.

01:26:22.740 --> 01:26:24.700
I can't believe it.

01:26:24.700 --> 01:26:26.700
Art makes you forget time.

01:26:26.700 --> 01:26:30.000
I think so, but...

01:26:35.240 --> 01:26:36.240
What?!

01:26:38.780 --> 01:26:40.280
Omitsuki-kun, hurry!

01:26:49.080 --> 01:26:53.190
Aren't there a lot of stone statues around here?

01:26:53.550 --> 01:26:56.550
Really? That looks exactly like the one in the principal's office.

01:26:57.060 --> 01:27:00.000
Look carefully, Meppo! This is not just a stone statue, Meppo!

01:27:12.640 --> 01:27:13.250
I feel it!

01:27:13.250 --> 01:27:19.360
I'm still here.

01:27:19.360 --> 01:27:20.770
Prepare yourself!

01:27:32.460 --> 01:27:38.080
I see.

01:27:38.080 --> 01:27:39.350
How dare you?

01:27:39.350 --> 01:27:40.350
Don't mess with us!

01:27:40.350 --> 01:27:44.920
Show them the terror of the evil spirit and the power of darkness!

01:30:00.440 --> 01:30:02.530
the subordinates of the power of God!

01:30:42.800 --> 01:30:46.320
Well then, it's about time for the final showtime.

01:31:12.800 --> 01:31:28.740
If you attack too hard and destroy the stone statue, you will know what will happen to the original human, but you can say whatever you want.

01:31:31.500 --> 01:31:32.720
If you can do it!

01:31:58.570 --> 01:32:00.000
That Tatsumaki got in the way!

01:32:50.280 --> 01:32:52.080
If you shoot like that, Sekizou will get caught too!

01:33:34.000 --> 01:33:35.140
I can't do this!

01:33:38.300 --> 01:33:42.250
Mr. Kashiwada, where did he go?

01:33:42.340 --> 01:33:42.840
Ah!

01:34:00.570 --> 01:34:01.680
"Huh?"

01:34:01.680 --> 01:34:02.900
"Aaah!"

01:34:02.900 --> 01:34:06.760
"What's wrong with me? I don't remember anything."

01:34:06.760 --> 01:34:11.940
"But I had a dream. It was a wonderful dream."

01:34:11.940 --> 01:34:24.540
"I was watching the shooting stars with Piccolini. Then one of them flew towards me and hit Piccolini's head."

01:34:24.540 --> 01:34:27.880
"But it was so much fun."

01:34:34.960 --> 01:34:35.920
That's what they say.

01:34:35.920 --> 01:34:38.040
What are they talking about?

01:34:38.040 --> 01:34:40.050
Well, it's fine, it's fine!

01:34:40.050 --> 01:34:41.440
Let's go to the class.

01:34:41.440 --> 01:34:42.790
Everyone's waiting.

01:34:42.790 --> 01:34:48.690
Yeah!

01:34:48.690 --> 01:34:51.820
Hmm...

01:34:51.820 --> 01:34:54.770
Sensei, this is the first time I've seen that work.

01:34:54.770 --> 01:34:56.130
It's wonderful.

01:34:56.130 --> 01:34:58.020
This unique pose...

01:34:58.020 --> 01:35:00.000
This is truly a masterpiece.

01:35:00.600 --> 01:35:01.480
Yes.

01:36:46.990 --> 01:36:47.900
It's fun.

01:36:47.900 --> 01:36:48.880
Aren't you overdoing it?

01:36:48.880 --> 01:36:51.000
I wonder if that's so.

01:36:51.000 --> 01:36:52.980
It's like we just passed each other.

01:36:52.980 --> 01:36:54.830
Maybe the world we live in is different.

01:36:54.830 --> 01:36:56.790
Wait, Yukishiro-san?

01:36:56.790 --> 01:36:57.810
Where?

01:36:57.810 --> 01:36:58.670
Where did you go?

01:36:58.670 --> 01:37:00.000
No way...

01:37:01.310 --> 01:37:04.120
This is Precure, Magiava, and Semi's Feastard.

01:37:04.120 --> 01:37:07.970
We met again...
